* Cells of the RRAM macro's 3-bit flash ADC (flash_tb.sp), PTM 65 nm bulk, L = 65 nm.
.subckt inv a y vdd s=1
MP y a vdd vdd pmos w={s*260n} l=65n
MN y a 0 0 nmos w={s*130n} l=65n
.ends
.subckt nand2 a b y vdd s=1
MP1 y a vdd vdd pmos w={s*260n} l=65n
MP2 y b vdd vdd pmos w={s*260n} l=65n
MN1 y a m 0 nmos w={s*260n} l=65n
MN2 m b 0 0 nmos w={s*260n} l=65n
.ends
.subckt nand4 a b c d y vdd s=1
MP1 y a vdd vdd pmos w={s*260n} l=65n
MP2 y b vdd vdd pmos w={s*260n} l=65n
MP3 y c vdd vdd pmos w={s*260n} l=65n
MP4 y d vdd vdd pmos w={s*260n} l=65n
MN1 y a m1 0 nmos w={s*520n} l=65n
MN2 m1 b m2 0 nmos w={s*520n} l=65n
MN3 m2 c m3 0 nmos w={s*520n} l=65n
MN4 m3 d 0 0 nmos w={s*520n} l=65n
.ends
* SR latch (cross-coupled NAND), active-low inputs: sn = 0 sets q, rn = 0 resets q
.subckt srln sn rn q qb vdd
X1 sn qb q vdd nand2
X2 rn q qb vdd nand2
.ends
* StrongARM, NMOS inputs (references at or above mid-rail). clk high = evaluate. on / op
* are high in reset; on falls when inp > inn, op falls when inp < inn.
.subckt sa_n inp inn clk on op vdd
MT  tail clk 0 0 nmos w=520n l=65n
M1  x1 inp tail 0 nmos w=520n l=65n
M2  x2 inn tail 0 nmos w=520n l=65n
M3  on op x1 0 nmos w=260n l=65n
M4  op on x2 0 nmos w=260n l=65n
M5  on op vdd vdd pmos w=260n l=65n
M6  op on vdd vdd pmos w=260n l=65n
MR1 on clk vdd vdd pmos w=260n l=65n
MR2 op clk vdd vdd pmos w=260n l=65n
MR3 x1 clk vdd vdd pmos w=260n l=65n
MR4 x2 clk vdd vdd pmos w=260n l=65n
.ends
* StrongARM, PMOS inputs (references below mid-rail). clkb low = evaluate. on / op are low
* in reset; op rises when inp > inn, on rises when inp < inn.
.subckt sa_p inp inn clkb on op vdd
MT  tail clkb vdd vdd pmos w=1040n l=65n
M1  x1 inp tail vdd pmos w=1040n l=65n
M2  x2 inn tail vdd pmos w=1040n l=65n
M3  on op x1 vdd pmos w=520n l=65n
M4  op on x2 vdd pmos w=520n l=65n
M5  on op 0 0 nmos w=130n l=65n
M6  op on 0 0 nmos w=130n l=65n
MR1 on clkb 0 0 nmos w=130n l=65n
MR2 op clkb 0 0 nmos w=130n l=65n
MR3 x1 clkb 0 0 nmos w=130n l=65n
MR4 x2 clkb 0 0 nmos w=130n l=65n
.ends
* One comparator slice, output latched: q = 1 when vin > ref
.subckt cmp_n vin ref clk q qb vdd
XS vin ref clk on op vdd sa_n
XL on op q qb vdd srln
.ends
.subckt cmp_p vin ref clkb q qb vdd
XS vin ref clkb on op vdd sa_p
XI1 op sn vdd inv
XI2 on rn vdd inv
XL sn rn q qb vdd srln
.ends
